The quotient prefilter is in place, and I’m sweeping quotient primes and fixed run counts against the exact structure-aware sampler. This is specifically to avoid “large nominal language, dense valid subset”: the shipping choice will be based on zero hits in the mandated 200,000 trials and zero successes for 4,096-restart attacks, not on cardinality alone.
