+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Lemma 2.4 (the Factor Group Lemma) and Case 2 of the proof "
+        "give a constructive algorithm; ordinary lift materialization is "
+        "O(|G|) and takes |G| exact group steps (7,130,461 at the shipping "
+        "preset with seed 0), whereas recognizing and writing the eight-run "
