+        "A JSON object {repeat:N,runs:[[S,e],...]} with exactly L runs; "
+        "S is X or Y, every e is a nonzero integer, the absolute exponents "
+        "sum to p, and repeat is the displayed N."
+    ),
+    "bounds": {
